'''Lightning Beam''' is a [[debuff]] from the map boss [[Shock and Horror]]'s skill of the same name (id [[Skill:SeawitchLightningBeam|SeawitchLightningBeam]]). The debuff icon is the same as [[Degeneration Aura]] (lightning damage variant), [[Scientist's Beam]] and [[Piety Beam]], etc.

==Damage==
Based on datamined values ([[Skill:SeawitchLightningBeam|SeawitchLightningBeam]]), the beam from [[Shock and Horror]] deals 4000 lightning damage per second (at monster level 72), which excluding other scaling such as monster mod (e.g. map boss' [[Modifier:MonsterAuraAddedLightningDamage|Allies deal additional lightning damage]] aura), map mod , etc.

==Other variants==
By the description of the {{il|Imperfect Eldritch Eye}}/{{il|Eldritch Eye}}{{il|Perfect Eldritch Eye}} corpse, the monster (as a spectre) also use this skill. However, the player never able to encounter this monster unless in PVP, and the monster use a skill internally known as [[Skill:GSAzmeriTentacleMonsterBeam|GSAzmeriTentacleMonsterBeam]], which is not the same as [[Shock and Horror]]'s skill.

Also, do not confuse this skill with [[Automaton Lightning Beam]], used by [[Heist]] monsters, or the [[Corrupted Lightning Beam]] used by Act 4 [[Piety, the Abomination]], or [[Piety Beam]] from her human form.
